    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        91,
        1030,
        1857,
        1825
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The general functions and purposes of these bodies shall be to\nplan, organize, coordinate, stimulate and conduct efforts which are or may be\nintended to reduce the proportions and impact of poverty by attacking its root causes\nas well as its manifestations, including (a) discrimination in all its pertinent\nforms; (b) unemployment; (c) underemployment; (d) lack of vocational training;\n(e) lack of basic literacy; (f) family disorganization; (g) lack of job opportunities;\n(h) remediable physical, mental or emotional handicaps' (i) slum conditions;\n(j) lack of training in homemaking and housekeeping essentials; (k) consumer\nexploitation; (l) lack of the ability to assert legal rights; (m) neighborhood\ndisorganization; and (n) inter-group tensions.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.4214,
          "min": -1.8202
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0003
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 175,
          "mean": -0.0274,
          "min": -1.4838
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 59375,
        "area_px": 1267230,
        "density": 0.04685,
        "chars": 753,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.68
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        101,
        1857,
        1907,
        2322
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The mechanism described in this Order is designed to (a) mobilize and\nconcentrate the maximum of both governmental and non-governmental resources; (b) arouse,\nmobilize and coordinate the directions of citizen effort; and (c) seek, channel and\nutilize maximum fiscal and other assistance from the Federal and State Governments\nand from private foundations and other sources of such support for the efforts to be\nundertaken, for the purposes above stated.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3592,
          "min": -1.6854
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 96,
          "mean": -0.0073,
          "min": -0.5319
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 22953,
        "area_px": 765880,
        "density": 0.02997,
        "chars": 453,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.74
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81,
        2356,
        1924,
        3165
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In mounting and prosecuting such efforts, chief emphasis is to\nprovide to those undertakings which will: (a) provide training and increase\neducational and vocational skills and capacities; (b) promote and expand employment\nopportunities; (c) combat discrimination in all forms and all its effects, especially\nwith regard to education, training, employment and housing; (d) promote constructive\nand dynamic neighborhood conditions and forces; (e) improve housing conditions; and\n(f) otherwise stimulate, motivate and channel the energies of the impoverished and\nsocially handicapped, for self-improvement which must inevitably result in\nimmeasurably better social benefits including reductions in fiscal burdens upon\nthe City, State and Federal Governments.\"",
